      "content": "but that's just what they want people to think lol. if they can collect gait and foot pressure, they can basically map out how stressed or tired someone is without ever asking for a medical record. there's no way they aren't using that data for something bigger behind the scenes. i just feel like there has to be some kind of paper trail or leaked info about how these data pipelines actually work. have you seen anything about \"behavioral biometric\" harvesting in smart wearables?",
